tle into a pile of rubble before they do it to you first. No grinding waves of bots. No 20-minute matches. Just real-time 1v1 PvP where one good angle wins the war.\n\nDESTROY THE WALLS, NOT THE CLOCK\nMatches are quick. Decisions are not. Pick your shot, read the enemy line, and fire. Every wall, tower and turret is destructible, so the map is never the same twice. Collapse a floor under an archer. Carve your own path, literally.\n\nDRAFT YOUR SQUAD\nWrecker, Napalmer, Bomber, Scout, Fairy, Crow... Pick any 8. Each unit changes how you play, what angles you attack, and how you defend. Some builds are patient. Some are chaos. None of them are wrong if they win.\n\nFORTIFY THE KEEP\nYour castle is your army's home, shield, and weapon. Reinforce the walls that matter. Leave decoys. Bait your rival into breaking through somewhere they shouldn't. Defense isn't passive here, it's a trap.\n\nTHE FORGE\nUpgrade your units. Strengthen your keep. Unlock new arenas with new hazards, new obstacles, new ways to break things. The deeper you go, the meaner the meta gets.\n\nCLIMB THE LADDER\nClimb your away towards Clash Colosseum. Arena by arena. Seasonal leaderboards. Rank matches against players who want your crown as badly as you want theirs. Only one castle stays standing. Sharpen your aim. Stack your squad. Crack their keep. The arena is open. Go break something.\n\nCastle Busters is free to download and play. Some items are available for purchase with real money. A network connection is required. You must be at least 13 years old to play.", "minimumOsVersion": "15.0", "bundleId": "com.epicoro.castleclashers", "userRatingCount": 4473}]}